# Allowlist: only what the image build needs is sent to Docker.
# Tests, docs, the README and the VIA rebuild scripts stay out, so editing
# them never invalidates the build cache.
*
!package.json
!scripts/
scripts/via/
!site/
!docker/
**/.DS_Store
# Also excluded by the * above; listed so it stays out if the allowlist changes.
.agent/
